# UnrealScript: UnrealScript Language Reference (Epic Games, UE3); requirements/languages/unrealscript.md
name     unrealscript uc
keyword  class extends var local function event state simulated native static final if else for
keyword  foreach while do switch case default break continue return new self super defaultproperties
keyword  replication reliable unreliable config localized const enum struct
type     int float bool byte string name vector rotator Object Actor
builtin  true false None Log Spawn
fold-case
line-comment   //
block-comment  /* */
string   " "  : escapes
string   ' '  : name
operators  +-*/%&|^!<>=:?~.$@
calls
